Motor Format:
1698654321
9 is motor 1
1 is motor 8
Value 1 =0% 9 = 100%
Value 0 is 0%

Another example:
-1699988888
999 = Motor ID
88888 = Percentage value (11-value format)


GAME PAD FORMAT
1899887766
99 Horizontal Left Joystick 1-99
88 Vertical Left Joystick 1-99
77 Horizontal Right Joystick 1-99
66 Vertical Right Joystick 1-99


MIDI FORMAT
1600 – Play full note 0 | 2600 – Release note 0
1727 – Play full note 127 | 2727 – Release note 127
Format: 13 99 888 777
Example: 1301065125
13 I am a midi note
99 I am on this channel (0 means that the following is a controller).
888 I am a note number
777 I am a velocity


